description:
Job Description Job Descriptions: 

 Process and docket incoming correspondence from the USPTO; 
 Process and docket client instructions accurately and in a timely manner; 
 Review and delegate USPTO and client correspondence to the appropriate team members for timely action. 
 Enter new patent and trademark matters into the IP Manager docketing system; 
 Prepare and distribute daily, weekly, and customized docket reports; 
 Review and clear daily docket reports and process USPTO filing…
